# durability: track the load-bearing verdict evidence in place (the rest of runs/ stays ignored).
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded, so re-include the dirs, re-exclude their
# contents, then re-include the specific curated files. See STUDIO_RUN_REPORT.md durability note.
!runs/
runs/*
!runs/pre_studio/
runs/pre_studio/*
!runs/pre_studio/close_e7_sparse.json
!runs/pre_studio/close_ex5_local_rules.json
!runs/pre_studio/close_ex2_planning.json
!runs/pre_studio/close_b5_degeneracy.json
!runs/pre_studio/frozen_random_census.json
!runs/pre_studio/census_reaudit.json
!runs/pre_studio/RESULTS_PRE_STUDIO.md
!runs/mot/
runs/mot/*
!runs/mot/dr13_predictor_fidelity.json

